    {
      "id": "wikipedia-section-expansion-contract",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Section Expansion Contract",
      "position": {"x": 420, "y": -180},
      "width": 600,
      "height": 460,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "ports": [{"id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 210}],
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Section expansion\n\n1. Resolve the article shell and section manifest.\n2. Derive one **labeled dynamic handle** per section. The visible hover label is the section title.\n3. Dragging from a section handle instantiates a `wikipedia-section` node.\n4. Seed the new node with the parent article URL/title/revision plus section id/title/level/order/source locator.\n5. The new Section resolves its own body lazily.\n6. If it contains subsections, apply the same handle grammar recursively.\n\nThe template deliberately does **not** materialize the whole article graph up front. References, infoboxes, categories, images, and general link semantics stay outside v1.\n\n### Runtime boundary\n\nThe classes and instance contract are defined here. Runtime support still needs to read `dynamicPorts` / `dynamicPortContract` and turn section manifest entries into real labeled handles whose drag expansion instantiates the declared Section class."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wikipedia-template-runtime-controller",
      "type": "script",
      "label": "Wikipedia Section Expansion",
      "position": {"x": 420, "y": 340},
      "width": 600,
      "height": 320,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "ports": [{"id": "trigger", "label": "trigger", "direction": "input", "dataType": "trigger", "angle": 180}, {"id": "result", "label": "result", "direction": "output", "dataType": "value", "angle": 0}],
      "data": {
        "scriptId": "wikipedia-section-expansion",
        "scriptName": "Wikipedia Section Expansion",
        "allowMutations": true,
        "dryRun": false,
        "autoRun": false,
        "autoRunOnLoad": false,
        "autoRunOnGraphChange": false,
        "memo": "Runtime integration point for resolving article manifests, creating labeled section handles, and instantiating Section nodes from drag expansion.",
        "status": "contract-defined-runtime-pending",
        "requirements": [
          "Wikipedia article resolver",
          "Dynamic handle derivation from a node data array",
          "Hover labels sourced from section.title",
          "Drag expansion event with originating dynamic handle metadata",
          "Permission to instantiate wikipedia-section"
        ],
        "effects": [
          "Populate article title, lead, revision, attribution, first section, and section manifest",
          "Expose one labeled handle per section",
          "Instantiate a transient Wikipedia Section from the dragged handle",
          "Repeat recursively for subsections"
        ],
        "visibilityRole": "editor"
      }
    },
